# Canonical site origin used for canonical URLs, JSON-LD @id, sitemap, RSS and llms.txt.
#
# Leave unset and the build will detect the host automatically:
#   - Vercel:      VERCEL_PROJECT_PRODUCTION_URL / VERCEL_URL
#   - Netlify:     URL / DEPLOY_PRIME_URL
#   - Cloudflare:  CF_PAGES_URL
#   - otherwise:   http://localhost:4321 (local development)
#
# Set this in production to pin the real domain:
# SITE_URL=https://your-domain.com
SITE_URL=
